## Multi-Agent Plans (READ FIRST)

Before creating plans for multiple agents, you **MUST** read `planning/plans.mdc` and follow its structure exactly.

When **implementing** a plan that specifies parallel subagents, read `development/parallel-subagents.mdc` and confirm your parallel execution strategy before launching subagents — this is the organizer's workflow (see `roles/organizer.mdc`).

